Found on the way, pre-existing on dev: test_check_schema_coverage.py swapped
the COMMITTED .ci/schema-coverage-baseline.json in place. Under xdist the
tests raced on that one path: 3 of 12 failed on dev, 3 to 7 on this branch,
and the file was left deleted. check-schema-coverage gains --baseline PATH;
each test runs on a private file (3 consecutive runs: 13/13). A new test
asserts an --update-baseline run leaves the committed file byte-identical.

The schema-coverage baseline shrinks by 3 values the new fixtures cover:
type_alias, dispatch_pattern, function_reference_arg.

